{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03138","headline":"高斋闲望言怀 · 张九龄","name":"高斋闲望言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高斋复晴景，延眺属清秋。\n风物动归思，烟林生远愁。\n纷吾自穷海，薄宦此中州。\n取路无高足，随波适下流。\n岁华空冉冉，心曲且悠悠。\n坐惜芳时歇，胡然久滞留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}